  m_Text: "The Rules\n\n1. Use the ASD keys to control the player\u2019s forward,
    left, and right rotation.\n2. Use the spacebar to fire bullets.\n3. Click the
    button below to place blocks that change the bullet\u2019s direction. The game
    ends when a bullet hits an \u201CX\u201D block."
